<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Abercrombie &amp; Fitch.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Abercrombie &amp; Fitch.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Montgomery Securities analyst Alice Ruth said she initiated coverage of outdoor apparel retailer Abercrombie &amp; Fitch Co, with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Ruth said she expects the company to earn $0.44 per share in the fiscal year ending in January 1997, $0.60 per share the next year, and $0.80 per share in the January 1999 year. She said she has a 12 month target price range in the high $20s to low $30s.</p>
</text>
